# rows-enter (H4): Enter after typing "2.5" into a's field — the value set,
# the URL updated (a=2.5), the box showing "2.50".
# Coordinates are this tree's (the function card is 104 tall without
# the readout): row a/k/b/h at y 277/321/382/426. h4-readout grows the
# function card by 133.5, landing rows at the reference y; flip back then.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 331 299
wait 150
key a ctrl
wait 100
type "2.5"
wait 200
key Enter
wait 400
shot rows-enter
